+# One-off diagnostic build for the memory corruption surfacing near the
+# OpenGL 3D renderer (see docs/melonds-setup.md) -- ENABLE_ASAN=ON
+# compiles `core` itself with ASan instrumentation so an out-of-bounds
+# write gets caught at the actual buggy line instead of wherever it
+# happens to crash later. dscore's own CMakeLists.txt matches this with
+# the same flag for dsjni.cpp/ds_platform.cpp, since mixing sanitized
+# and unsanitized code in one process risks missing the write itself.
+if (ENABLE_ASAN)
